    "created_at": "2018-09-18T17:34:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-19T13:03:57Z",
    "body": "Implementer convenience is not what we should be optimising for.\r\n\r\nAIUI Fetch is a low-level HTTP API -- as per [EWM](https://extensiblewebmanifesto.org/) -- and that means it should not impose its views on its users, nor preclude any (safe, sane) functionality. \r\n\r\nTalking to @mcmanus, I was lead to believe this wasn't necessarily a big deal to correct; Patrick, any comment?",
