    "created_at": "2020-03-25T21:28:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-25T21:28:46Z",
    "body": "Fetch also says:\r\n\r\n> If header list contains `If-Modified-Since`, `If-None-Match`, `If-Unmodified-Since`, `If-Match`, or `If-Range`, fetch will set cache mode to \"no-store\" if it is \"default\".\r\n\r\nThis means that if the developer's intent is to do validation manually, Fetch will effectively disable that by appending `Cache-Control: no-cache`. ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
